# 262,144 tokens with decode context parallelism (TF_GLM53_DCP=4: the KV cache is split across the four ranks).
# Measured 2026-10-05 through the /v1 server: loads and serves, drafting stays exact (drafted == this server's serial),
# but it is another numeric path (its serial ids differ from the 32K / 160K ids) and it is slower: 6-prompt drafted mean
# 35.9 tok/s vs 41.1 at fast-160k, SixCat decode p50 57.08 vs 69.19, prefill 232.2 vs 313.4 tok/s (prompt chunks are
# capped at 1024 rows under DCP). bf16 at 262,144 unsplit (DCP=1) does not fit: it swapped and tripped the watchdog.
PROFILE_VALIDATED=1
TFS_CONTEXT="${TFS_CONTEXT:-262144}"
TF_GLM53_DCP="${TF_GLM53_DCP:-4}"
TFS_KV_DTYPE="${TFS_KV_DTYPE:-bf16}"
BENCH_IDS="${BENCH_IDS:-self}"          # bench: drafted == this server's own "draft": false ids (not the 32K reference)
